{"role":"assistant","content":"Now `server.py` — exchange, storage, expiry handling, and the init endpoint:","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_g9wYO3lybUe5tlgIRokhV2jm","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"server.py\",\"old_string\":\"AUTHORIZE_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \\\"/oauth/authorize\\\"\\nDEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600   # seconds; used when the provider does not say how long a token lives\\n\\n# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\\nUSERS = {\\n    \\\"tok-okafor\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_okafor\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"C. Okafor\\\"},\\n    \\\"tok-rivera\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_rivera\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"T. Rivera\\\"},\\n}\\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, refresh_token, scope, expires_at, status}\",\"new_string\":\"AUTHORIZE_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \\\"/oauth/authorize\\\"\\n\\n# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\\nUSERS = {\\n    \\\"tok-okafor\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_okafor\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"C. Okafor\\\"},\\n    \\\"tok-rivera\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_rivera\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"T. Rivera\\\"},\\n}\\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, scope, status}\"}"}}]}
